title Home Assistant: an error line: unlocking the back door fails on the server ("Lock jammed"): the status line names it
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 900
key end
key up
key up
key up
key up
key enter
wait 600
expect text "Back door"
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Unlock Back door?"
key enter
wait 600
expect text "Could not unlock Back door: Lock jammed"
shot error-line
check error-line
expect noquit
